  "title": "New Arrivals | PRADA Launches the Essence Collection of Bags and Accessories: Dalmatian Spots in Calf Hair",
  "original_title": "新包 | PRADA 上架 Essence 系列手袋和配饰：斑点狗纹，小牛毛皮",
  "excerpt": "Prada expands its Essence collection with calf-hair bags featuring playful black-and-white Dalmatian spots for a plush, charming look.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-14",
