      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "PRADA adds new bags and accessories to its Essence collection this week, with the Avoir mini flap bag and Bonnie top-handle bag among the pieces reworked in fluffy calf hair. The short, fine natural pile has a plush texture, and the standout detail is an allover black-and-white Dalmatian spot print that makes each bag feel as playful and charming as a little pet.",
